Subject: [PATCH] feat: replace 2D SVG airplane with real 3D folded-paper
 airplane

- New custom low-poly origami geometry (raised ridge, V cross-section,
  two-panel wings at different angles, keel fin, paper-thickness edges,
  thin ruby crease accents) in paper-plane-model.ts
- Single Three.js canvas driven by scroll progress along a 3D Catmull-Rom path
- Quaternion orientation from path tangent (nose = +Z), flips with scroll
  direction; banking from turn rate; idle hover; restrained fading trail
- Paper-like PBR materials, key/fill/rim/under lighting, soft shadows
- Reduced-motion static frame, mobile simplification, visibility pause,
  WebGL-unavailable fallback, full cleanup on unmount
